35
00:00:51,127 --> 00:00:52,539
sin haber sentido realmente

36
00:00:52,539 --> 00:00:53,598
la satisfacción de lo

37
00:00:53,598 --> 00:00:54,675
que acabas de lograr.

38
00:00:55,924 --> 00:00:57,537
El investigador Thomas Curran

39
00:00:57,537 --> 00:00:59,387
documentó, junto con Andrew

40
00:00:59,387 --> 00:01:01,264
Hill, un aumento significativo

41
00:01:01,264 --> 00:01:02,638
