113
00:02:55,237 --> 00:02:55,610
en algo.

114
00:02:56,838 --> 00:02:57,259
Un jefe,

115
00:02:57,259 --> 00:02:58,492
un cliente o un

116
00:02:58,492 --> 00:02:59,686
